{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the darkness and madness with this VR action that blends shooter and horror elements. Expect intense combat, terrifying enemies, and mysterious missions in a world where every step could be your last. Fight monstrous creatures, level up your skills, and uncover the secrets of a corporation conducting deadly experiments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide array of weapons\u2014from pistols and assault rifles to flamethrowers and turrets. Every battle demands precision and quick reflexes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skills: increase your fire rate, boost damage, activate sniper mode, and customize weapons to suit your playstyle. Progression gives you a real advantage in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surprises in Every Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is unique. The process of their generation ensures that each playthrough is truly different. Crack codes, rescue survivors, and wipe out hostile forces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, claustrophobic spaces, grotesque creatures, and sudden attacks. Constant fear and tension in every minute of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies You Can\u2019t Ignore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens, mutants, dinosaurs, and other horrific creations. Every enemy requires its own tactics and preparation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing missions, you\u2019ll face epic battles with giant bosses that will test your skills and endurance.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708210?t=1766109182","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708210/ea83d8c6471