Ignore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens, mutants, dinosaurs, and other horrific creations. Every enemy requires its own tactics and preparation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing missions, you\u2019ll face epic battles with giant bosses that will test your skills and endurance.</p>","developers":["MAKSIMOV VALERII"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708210/23574f4efbf3f3b1f71599f8fd091e9a759d7906/header.jpg?t=1766109182","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/1746893308/ad455498664392498be7bb4c80c4403d327716c2/1765500261/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765501183","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/1746893308/ad455498664392498be7bb4c80c4403d327716c2/1765500261/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765501183","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/1746893308/ad455498664392498be7bb4c80c4403d327716c2/1765500261/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765501183","id":257247810,"name":"2nd trailer of the game Xenolocus","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257247810/957ce7b47578d914ae6bd126c7c27641a7468b77/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765501183"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/1450675211/0cf1dd62f688b1ea92e1f6626617ea4cd5430c4f/1755638532/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765501184","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/1450675211/0cf1dd62f688b1ea92e1f6626617ea4cd5430c4f/1755638532/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765501184","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708210/1450675211/0cf1dd62f688b1ea92e1f6626617ea4cd5430c4f/1755638532/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765501184","id":257185647,"name":"1st trailer of the game Xenolocus","thumbnail":"https:/